    "body": "- VSCode Version: 1.5.1\n- OS Version: Win 7 Home Pro 64\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n1. Configure all privacy options to false as per [https://code.visualstudio.com/Docs#privacy](https://code.visualstudio.com/Docs#privacy)\n2. Block VSCode at firewall\n3. Start VSCode\n4. VSCode reports 'connect EACCES 191.238.172.191:443' error\n\nI would like to be able to control internet access without having this error message. This problem did not occur in VSCode 1.4. It would be good if there was a privacy setting to prevent this attempted access.\n",
